tString\\\": \\\"To: Chief Delta\\\\nFrom: Director Vanto\\\\nReference Order ID: 20250629-ORDER-VANTO-08\\\\n\\\\n**Subject: Acknowledgment and Standby for Technical Package**\\\\n\\\\nSir, I have received your directive. I understand my task is to stand by while Director Gideon and his team generate the detailed technical package for the final DEP.\\\\n\\\\nI am prepared to receive this information and will commence with drafting the complete, user-facing DEP as soon as you forward it.\\\\n\\\\nStanding by.\\\",\\n  \\\"originalOrderID\\\": \\\"20250629-ORDER-VANTO-08\\\"\\n}\\n###REPORT-20250629-ORDER-VANTO-08###\"}]},{\"role\":\"model\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"I have received Director Gideon's acknowledgment of my order (`#20250629-ORDER-GIDEON-06`). He has correctly realigned his specialist team to produce the detailed technical specifications necessary for the final Deterministically Executable Plan (DEP). The project is proceeding as planned.\\n\\nThe firm is now in a state where we are awaiting the completion of this detailed technical analysis. Director Gideon's team is working, and Director Vanto is standing by to receive their output, as per my previous orders.\\n\\nTo maintain a record of the current status and to satisfy the system's requirement for a non-blank response, I will issue a clarifying order to Director Vanto. This order will formally acknowledge that we are waiting on Director Gideon and will instruct Director Vanto to report to me as soon as he receives the completed technical specifications. This creates a clear trigger for the next step in our process.\\n\\n###20250629-ORDER-VANTO-07-STANDBY###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nFrom: Chief Delta\\nTo: System\\nType: ORDER\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"orderString\\\": \\\"Director Vanto, I have received confirmation from Director Gideon that his team is now producing the detailed technical specification. Your task to formulate the user-facing directives is contingent on this document. Please stand by. Report to me as so